1
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Every story has a hero. Every hero has a destiny. Every saga has an end.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Star Wars: Episode III - Revenge of the Sith is a adventure,
action, science fiction film directed by George Lucas.

3
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
When the sinister Sith unveil a thousand-year-old plot to rule the galaxy, the
Republic crumbles and from its ashes rises the evil Galactic Empire.

4
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Jedi hero Anakin Skywalker must choose a side.

5
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Anakin Skywalker / Darth Vader, played by Hayden Christensen.

6
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Obi-Wan Kenobi, played by Ewan McGregor.

7
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:06,000
Padmé Amidala, played by Natalie Portman.

8
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Chancellor Palpatine / Darth Sidious, played by Ian McDiarmid.

9
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Mace Windu, played by Samuel L. Jackson.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Senator Bail Organa, played by Jimmy Smits.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Star Wars: Episode III – Revenge of the Sith is an action video
game based on the 2005 film of the same name.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It was released on May 5, 2005, for the PlayStation 2, Xbox,
Game Boy Advance, Nintendo DS, and Symbian OS.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
For the Xbox 360's backwards compatible lineup, Revenge of the Sith is one
out of the 400+ backwards compatible games for the 360.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
As part of the PlayStation 2 classics program, the PlayStation 2 version was re-released in Europe on the
PlayStation Network on February 11, 2015, and in North America on April 28, 2015 for PlayStation 3.

15
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
Meanwhile, the Xbox version was also added to the backwards compatibility
list for the Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S on November 15, 2021.

16
01:52:00,000 --> 01:52:06,000
A PlayStation Portable version was in development, but was cancelled.

17
01:59:00,000 --> 01:59:06,000
It received mixed reviews from critics.

18
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:06,000
The film explores themes of showdown, lava, fight, politics, volcano.

19
02:13:00,000 --> 02:13:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
